  "aiContextParagraph": "As the 2026 Black Friday shopping season arrives, Brazilian consumers are utilizing new digital tools, including AI, to locate deals and track pricing fluctuations. Experts note that while technology enhances the personalization of shopping experiences, it also changes pricing patterns. Amidst this transition, a significant portion of the public continues to report dissatisfaction with past promotions, with misleading advertising frequently leading to legal disputes. Financial apps have seen a surge in usage as shoppers plan their purchases. Consumers are advised to remain informed of their legal protections, particularly regarding delivery delays, as businesses are not permitted to force the acceptance of substitute goods if an item becomes unavailable. Additionally, studies suggest that the timing of purchases, with deeper discounts often appearing at specific times of the day, remains a critical factor for those looking to maximize savings during the event.",
